# Real Firebase config for local/manual testing. Excluded by default, but
# committing it is a reasonable choice once the Google OAuth consent
# screen's Test users list is set up as the real access gate (the values
# here are not secrets Google expects hidden) — see
# examples/voice-notes/REAL-KEYS.md Part 2 and firebase-config.example.js.
# Use `git add -f` to commit it if you've done that.
examples/*/firebase-config.js
